title: Process Termination via Taskkill
id: 75230b4d-5434-4db1-9351-b89997d80dc1
name: proc_creation_win_taskkill_process_termination
status: test
description: todo, just taskkill used to terminate a process.
references:
    - https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/dfir-report-the-gentlemen/
author: Luc Génaux
date: 2026-04-28
tags:
    - attack.defense-evasion
    - attack.t1562.001
logsource:
    product: windows
    category: process_creation
detection:
    selection_img:
        - OriginalFileName: 'taskkill.exe'
        - Image|endswith: '\taskkill.exe'
    selection_cli:
        CommandLine|windash|contains:
            #  - '/PID'  too many hits
            - '/IM'  # Image Name
            - '/FI'  # Filter, allow wildcard usage
    condition: all of selection_*
level: low
---
title: Process Termination via PowerShell
id: 930267af-f3a2-4236-b6a2-cb0643fcfdf1
name: proc_creation_win_powershell_process_termination
status: test
description: todo, just powershell used to terminate a process.
references:
    - https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/dfir-report-the-gentlemen/
author: Luc Génaux
date: 2026-04-28
tags:
    - attack.defense-evasion
    - attack.t1562.001
